{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22845","headline":"忆微之伤仲远 · 白居易","name":"忆微之伤仲远","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽独辞羣久，漂流去国赊。\n只将琴作伴，唯以酒爲家。\n感逝因看水，伤离爲见花。\n李三埋地底，元九谪天涯。\n举眼青云远，回头白日斜。\n可能胜贾谊，犹自滞长沙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22845.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22845","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}